  "payload": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <base href=\"/\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1,user-scalable=0\">\n\n  <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/x-icon\" href=\"https://www9.hays.com/UI/storybook/assets/live/img/favicon.ico\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Roboto:300,400,500&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/icon?family=Material+Icons\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  \n  \n  \n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://appres2.hays.com/styles.5d4f28847f3a854def60.css\"><title>Finance Business Partner Hays Working for your tomorrow</title><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Finance Business Partner\"><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Rotterdam | Finance Business Partner (Manufacturing &amp; Supply Chain)\"><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Rotterdam | Finance Business Partner (Manufacturing &amp; Supply Chain)\"><meta name=\"author\" content=\"Hays Working for your tomorrow\"><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.hays.nl/vacature-details/finance-business-partner-rotterdam_1050462\"><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"e-mails met onderzoeken, carrière advies, artikelen, publicaties  en events\"><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://www9.hays.com/UI/storybook/assets/img/hays-og-optimize-image-new.jpg\"><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"382\"><meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"200\"><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.hays.nl/vacature-details/finance-business-partner-rotterdam_1050462\"><script id=\"jobPostingSchema\" type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"http://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"title\":\"Finance Business Partner\",\"url\":\"https://www.hays.nl/vacature-details/finance-business-partner-rotterdam_1050462\",\"datePosted\":\"2026-08-31\",\"validThrough\":\"2026-11-29\",\"description\":\"<div>Travel:<br>Up to 2 days per week to manufacturing sites (approximately 40 minutes from Rotterdam) and one visit every two weeks to a second plant located approximately 1.5 hours north of Rotterdam.</div><p><br></p><div>About the Role</div><div>We are seeking an experienced<br>Finance Business Partner<br>to act as the primary financial advisor to a key business division, partnering closely with the Division CEO and senior operational leadership team.</div><div>This is a highly visible role at the intersection of<br>finance, manufacturing, supply chain, and operations, requiring an individual who can translate complex business performance into clear financial insights and actionable recommendations. The successful candidate will take ownership of understanding and explaining the division's full Profit & Loss performance while providing commercial and operational challenge to senior stakeholders.</div><div>A strong background in<br>Supply Chain Finance, Manufacturing Finance, Operations Finance, or Plant Finance within a production environment<br>is essential. This role requires someone who understands how operational decisions impact financial performance and who is comfortable challenging and influencing leaders across the business.</div><p><br></p><div>Key Responsibilities</div><div>Business Partnering & Stakeholder Management</div><ul><li>Serve as the lead Finance Business Partner for the division and the primary financial advisor to the Division CEO and leadership team.</li><li>Build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders across Operations, Supply Chain, Manufacturing, Commercial, and Corporate Finance functions.</li><li>Provide financial insight and challenge to support strategic and operational decision-making.</li><li>Influence business decisions by balancing service levels, production efficiency, lead times, complexity, and cost.</li></ul><div>Financial Performance & P&L Ownership</div><ul><li>Own the understanding, analysis, and explanation of the division's full P&L.</li><li>Identify key drivers of financial performance and recommend actions to improve results.</li><li>Analyse and explain variances in revenue, margins, manufacturing costs, and operational performance.</li><li>Improve visibility of cost of sales, profitability, and plant performance across business units.</li><li>Translate operational performance indicators into meaningful financial outcomes.</li></ul><div>FP&A, Forecasting & Reporting</div><ul><li>Lead and support budgeting, forecasting, performance reporting, and financial planning activities.</li><li>Partner with Group FP&A and Controllership teams to ensure accurate forecasting and reporting.</li><li>Deliver meaningful financial analysis that supports strategic planning and business growth.</li><li>Monitor financial performance and proactively identify risks and opportunities.</li></ul><div>Operational & Manufacturing Finance</div><ul><li>Work closely with manufacturing and supply chain teams to understand plant economics and operational performance.</li><li>Evaluate production efficiency, cost structures, inventory impacts, and margin drivers.</li><li>Identify and quantify cost savings, productivity improvements, synergies, and process optimisation opportunities.</li><li>Support continuous improvement initiatives through robust financial analysis and business cases.</li></ul><p><br></p><div>Candidate Profile</div><div>The ideal candidate combines strong commercial acumen with deep operational finance expertise gained within a manufacturing or production-led environment.</div><div>Essential Experience</div><ul><li>Significant experience in<br>Finance Business Partnering, FP&A, Operations Finance, Supply Chain Finance, Manufacturing Finance, or Controlling.</li><li>Proven experience supporting manufacturing, industrial, engineering, production, FMCG, chemicals, food, packaging, or other asset-intensive businesses.</li><li>Strong understanding of<br>supply chain, plant operations, manufacturing cost structures, and operational performance drivers.</li><li>Experience owning or supporting a complex P&L and explaining financial performance to senior stakeholders.</li><li>Demonstrated experience in forecasting, budgeting, variance analysis, and management reporting.</li><li>Track record of influencing business decisions through data-driven financial insights.</li></ul><div>Stakeholder Management</div><ul><li>Comfortable operating in a highly visible environment and engaging directly with senior leadership.</li><li>Strong communication skills with the ability to challenge and influence stakeholders constructively.</li><li>Capable of translating complex financial information into clear business recommendations.</li></ul><div>Matrix Organisation Experience</div><ul><li>Previous experience working within a<br>matrix organisation<br>is strongly preferred.</li><li>Comfortable collaborating across multiple functions, business units, and corporate finance teams, including FP&A, Treasury, Tax, and Controllership.</li></ul><div>Location & Eligibility</div><ul><li>Currently living in the Netherlands.</li><li>Holds a<br>Dutch passport, EU passport, or unrestricted right to work in the Netherlands.</li><li>Willing and able to travel regularly to manufacturing sites as part of the role.</li></ul><p><br></p><div>What Success Looks Like</div><div>This is not a role for someone who simply reports numbers. We are looking for a finance professional who can explain:</div><ul><li>Why performance changed</li><li>What operational factors drove the outcome</li><li>What actions should be taken next</li><li>How financial and operational performance can be improved</li></ul><div>The successful candidate will be a trusted partner to leadership, bringing together finance, operations, and strategy to drive better business decisions and stronger financial performance.</div><br><br>#LI-DNI<br> #1050462 - A. de Vries\",\"industry\":\"Industrieel & Productie\",\"employmentType\":\"Permanent\",\"baseSalary\":{\"@type\":\"MonetaryAmount\",\"currency\":\"euro\",\"value\":{\"@type\":\"QuantitativeValue\",\"value\":\"Competietive with strong secondary benefits\",\"unitText\":\"YEAR\"}},\"salaryCurrency\":\"euro\",\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Hays\",\"url\":\"https://www.hays.nl\",\"logo\":\"https://www9.hays.com/UI/storybook/assets/img/hays-og-optimize-image-new.jpg\"},\"jobLocation\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Rotterdam\",\"addressRegion\":\"Rotterdam\",\"addressCountry\":\"Netherlands\",\"postalCode\":\"NA\",\"streetAddress\":\"NA\"},\"geo\":{\"@type\":\"GeoCoordinates\",\"latitude\":\"51.91666667\",\"longitude\":\"4.46666667\"}}}</script></head>\n<body><noscript><iframe src=\"//www.googletagmanager.com/ns.html?id=GTM-54DSM2\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\" style=\"display:none;visibility:hidden\"></iframe></noscript>\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <div id=\"teconsent\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"consent_blackbar\"></div>\n  <app-root _nghost-sc16=\"\" ng-version=\"11.2.14\"><div _ngcontent-sc16=\"\" class=\"thank-you-container\"><div _ngcontent-sc16=\"\" class=\"container\"><router-outlet _ngcontent-sc16=\"\"></router-outlet><app-site-locale _nghost-sc54=\"\"><app-header _ngcontent-sc54=\"\"><div><header><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-6 col-md-8\"><a id=\"gtm_hayslogo\" href=\"https://www.hays.nl\" class=\"logo\"><img alt=\"Hays\" src=\"../../assets/images/img_logo_hays.webp\"></a></div><div class=\"col-6 col-md-4 text-right\"><a class=\"search-mobile\"><i class=\"icon-search\"></i></a><!----><a class=\"menu-mobile\"><em>Menu</em><i class=\"menu-icon\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></i></a></div></div><!----><!----></header></div><div><app-search-box _nghost-sc48=\"\"><div _ngcontent-sc48=\"\" class=\"search-container\"><form _ngcontent-sc48=\"\" novalidate=\"\" id=\"gtm_search_box\" class=\"ng-untouched ng-pristine ng-valid\"><div _ngcontent-sc48=\"\" class=\"form-row align-items-center\"><div _ngcontent-sc48=\"\" class=\"col-sm-12 col-md-4 my-1\"><label _ngcontent-sc48=\"\" for=\"inlineFormInputName\" class=\"sr-only\" textcontent=\"search_placeholder\">search_placeholder</label><i _ngcontent-sc48=\"\" class=\"icon-search\"></i><input _ngcontent-sc48=\"\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" id=\"inlineFormInputName\" maxlength=\"100\" class=\"form-control ng-untouched ng-pristine ng-valid\" placeholder=\"Zoek op trefwoord of functietitel\" value=\"\"><!----><!----></div><div _ngcontent-sc48=\"\" class=\"col-sm-12 col-md-4 my-1\"><label _ngcontent-sc48=\"\" for=\"inlineFormInputGroupUsername\" class=\"sr-only\">Plaats of provincie</label><i _ngcontent-sc48=\"\" class=\"icon-location\"></i><input _ngcontent-sc48=\"\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" id=\"inlineFormInputGroupUsername\" maxlength=\"100\" class=\"form-control ng-untouched ng-pristine ng-valid\" placeholder=\"Plaats of provincie\" value=\"\"></div><div _ngcontent-sc48=\"\" class=\"col-sm-12 col-md-2 my-1\"><button _ngcontent-sc48=\"\" id=\"gtm_search_btn\" type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-block\">Zoek vacatures</button></div></div><!----></form></div></app-search-box><!----><!----></div><!----></app-header><router-outlet _ngcontent-sc54=\"\"></router-outlet><app-jp-detail _nghost-sc67=\"\"><!----><section _ngcontent-sc67=\"\" class=\"job-detail-cont bg-light-grey\"><div _ngcontent-sc67=\"\" class=\"breadcrumb-cont\"><app-jp-breadcrumbs _ngcontent-sc67=\"\" _nghost-sc57=\"\"><ul _ngcontent-sc57=\"\" class=\"breadcrumb-cont\"><li _ngcontent-sc57=\"\"><a _ngcontent-sc57=\"\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\" id=\"gtm_detailpage_breadcrum_redirecttosearch\">Ga terug naar de zoekresultaten</a></li><li _ngcontent-sc57=\"\">Job</li></ul><!----><!----></app-jp-breadcrumbs></div><div _ngcontent-sc67=\"\" class=\"row\"><div _ngcontent-sc67=\"\" class=\"col-12 col-md-8\"><app-jp-job-description _ngcontent-sc67=\"\"