anagement</div><ul><li>Serve as the lead Finance Business Partner for the division and the primary financial advisor to the Division CEO and leadership team.</li><li>Build trusted relationships with senior stakeholders across Operations, Supply Chain, Manufacturing, Commercial, and Corporate Finance functions.</li><li>Provide financial insight and challenge to support strategic and operational decision-making.</li><li>Influence business decisions by balancing service levels, production efficiency, lead times, complexity, and cost.</li></ul><div>Financial Performance &amp; P&amp;L Ownership</div><ul><li>Own the understanding, analysis, and explanation of the division's full P&amp;L.</li><li>Identify key drivers of financial performance and recommend actions to improve results.</li><li>Analyse and explain variances in revenue, margins, manufacturing costs, and operational performance.</li><li>Improve visibility of cost of sales, profitability, and plant performance across business units.</li><li>Translate operational performance indicators into meaningful financial outcomes.</li></ul><div>FP&amp;A, Forecasting &amp; Reporting</div><ul><li>Lead and support budgeting, forecasting, performance reporting, and financial planning activities.</li><li>Partner with Group FP&amp;A and Controllership teams to ensure accurate forecasting and reporting.</li><li>Deliver meaningful financial analysis that supports strategic planning and business growth.</li><li>Monitor financial performance and proactively identify risks and opportunities.</li></ul><div>Operational &amp; Manufacturing Finance</div><ul><li>Work closely with manufacturing and supply chain teams to understand plant economics and operational performance.</li><li>Evaluate production efficiency, cost structures, inventory impacts, and margin drivers.</li><li>Identify and quantify cost savings, productivity improvements, synergies, and process optimisation opportunities.</li><li>Support continuous improvement initiatives through robust financial analysis and business cases.</li></ul><p><br></p><div>Candidate Profile</div><div>The ideal candidate combines strong commercial acumen with deep operational finance expertise gained within a manufacturing or production-led environment.</div><div>Essential Experience</div><ul><li>Significant experience in<br>Finance Business Partnering, FP&amp;A, Operations Finance, Supply Chain Finance, Manufacturing Finance, or Controlling.</li><li>Proven experience supporting manufacturing, industrial, engineering, production, FMCG, chemicals, food, packaging, or other asset-intensive businesses.</li><li>Strong understanding of<br>supply chain, plant operations, manufacturing cost structures, and operational performance drivers.</li><li>Experience owning or supporting a complex P&amp;L and explaining financial performance to senior stakeholders.</li><li>Demonstrated experience in forecasting, budgeting, variance analysis, and management reporting.</li><li>Track record of influencing business decisions through data-driven financial insights.</li></ul><div>Stakeholder Management</div><ul><li>Comfortable operating in a highly visible environment and engaging directly with senior leadership.</li><li>Strong communication skills with the ability to challenge and influence stakeholders constructively.</li><li>Capable of translating complex financial information into clear business recommendations.</li></ul><div>Matrix Organisation Experience</div><ul><li>Previous experience working within a<br>matrix organisation<br>is strongly preferred.</li><li>Comfortable collaborating across multiple functions, business units, and corporate finance teams, including FP&amp;A, Treasury, Tax, and Controllership.</li></ul><div>Location &amp; Eligibility</div><ul><li>Currently living in the Netherlands.</li><li>Holds a<br>Dutch passport, EU passport, or unrestricted right to work in the Netherlands.</li><li>Willing and able to travel regularly to manufacturing sites as part of the role.</li></ul><p><br></p><div>What Success Looks Like</div><div>This is not a role for someone who simply reports numbers. We are looking for a finance professional who can explain:</div><ul><li>Why performance changed</li><li>What operational factors drove the outcome</li><li>What actions should be taken next</li><li>How financial and operational performance can be improved</li></ul><div>The successful candidate will be a trusted partner to leadership, bringing together finance, operations, and strategy to drive better business decisions and stronger financial performance.</div><br><br>#LI-DNI<br> </div><!----><div _ngcontent-sc58=\"\" class=\"action-bar\"><button _ngcontent-sc58=\"\" id=\"gtm_job_desc_apply_btn\" class=\"btn btn-default\">Solliciteer nu</button></div><div _ngcontent-sc58=\"\"><div _ngcontent-sc58=\"\" id=\"GDPRPrivacyPolicy\" class=\"privacy-text\"><a _ngcontent-sc58=\"\" id=\"gtm_job_desc_gdprpolicylink\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.hays.nl/nl_NL/herzien-privacybeleid\">Klik hier</a><em _ngcontent-sc58=\"\" textcontent=\" \"> </em><span _ngcontent-sc58=\"\">om het privacybeleid van Hays te lezen, welke gedetailleerde informatie bevat over hoe we uw persoonlijke gegevens gebruiken en beschermen, en uw rechten in verband hiermee.</span></div></div><!----><!----><input _ngcontent-sc58=\"\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"jobCreatedDate\" value=\"2026-08-31\"><input _ngcontent-sc58=\"\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"jobExpiryDate\" value=\"2026-11-29\"></div><!----></app-jp-job-description></div><div _ngcontent-sc67=\"\" class=\"col-12 col-md-4\"><app-video-my-job _ngcontent-sc67=\"\" _nghost-sc59=\"\"><!----></app-video-my-job><app-job-summary _ngcontent-sc67=\"\" _nghost-sc60=\"\"><div _ngcontent-sc60=\"\" class=\"bg-white job-summary job-box\"><h3 _ngcontent-sc60=\"\">Overzicht</h3><div _ngcontent-sc60=\"\" class=\"hays-box-content\"><dl _ngcontent-sc60=\"\"><dt _ngcontent-sc60=\"\">Contractvorm</dt><dd _ngcontent-sc60=\"\" id=\"jd_type\">Permanent</dd